upd("n600", append="[Checked: in *Ord.* I d. 8 p. 1 q. 3 (Wadding/Vivès via SCTA) Scotus has ‘Item arguit Avicenna 8. Metaph. c. 4. quod Deus non est in genere’. So the source Gorris follows reads c. 4, and his *c. 10* (with B) is wrong. Verified for VIII c. 4 as Scotus’s citation.]", status="verified")
upd("n601", append="[Checked: *Ord.* I d. 8 p. 1 q. 3 (Wadding/Vivès via SCTA): ‘si esset albedo sub decimo gradu intensionis … posset tamen concipi sub ratione albedinis tante … vel … precise sub ratione albedinis’, and also ‘in una re est aliqua prima realitas a qua sumitur genus, et alia realitas a qua sumitur differentia’. Verified.]", status="verified")
